1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:02,990
Does this replace Gemini?

2
00:00:04,130 --> 00:00:05,160
No.

3
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:07,050
Developers get another choice.

4
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:10,120
No, Gemini isn't replaced.

5
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:12,740
Google Cloud simply offers a new model choice.

6
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:18,020
Model Garden is like a shelf.

7
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:21,500
OpenAI models and Codex workflows are joining it.

8
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,830
Developers can choose models for specific tasks,

9
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:28,490
not change your Gemini app.

10
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:34,120
Teams still need access controls,

11
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:36,460
policies, and responsible data governance.

12
00:00:39,780 --> 00:00:42,100
Availability will expand later.

13
00:00:42,190 --> 00:00:45,340
Always check access, pricing, and your actual use case.

